@startuml kairos-admin-dashboard-sequence
title Admin Dashboard Load

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "BI" as BI

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Admin Dashboard
WebAdmin -> API: GET /dashboard/admin/summary
API -> DB: Query KPIs\n(total members, attendance %, pending follow-ups,\npledges, recent activities)
DB --> API: KPI data
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {kpis, widgets}

WebAdmin -> BI: Load embedded report (token)
BI --> WebAdmin: BI iframe/visuals

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render dashboard (cards, charts, BI embed)

@enduml
